Name: edit
Version: @VERSION@
Release: 1%{?dist}
Summary: Editor de terminal estilo Turbo Vision
License: MIT
URL: https://github.com/
BuildArch: x86_64

%description
Editor TUI com menus Turbo Vision, núcleo ropey, abas,
terminal integrado e proteção contra perda de trabalho.

%install
mkdir -p %{buildroot}
cp -a @STAGE@/* %{buildroot}/

%files
/usr/bin/edit
/usr/share/applications/edit.desktop
/usr/share/metainfo/edit.metainfo.xml
/usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/edit.svg
/usr/share/icons/hicolor/48x48/apps/edit.png
/usr/share/icons/hicolor/128x128/apps/edit.png

%changelog
* Fri Jul 31 2026 edit contributors <edit@localhost> - @VERSION@-1
- Empacotamento RPM inicial
